{"id":"002f4c0140c1d3c2","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-ideal7-quotient-boolean-algebra.md","title":"ZFC Ideal7 Quotient Boolean Algebra","display":"df-zfc-ideal7-quotient-boolean-algebra — ZFC Ideal7 Quotient Boolean Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-quotient-boolean-algebra","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal7-quotient-boolean-algebra"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal7-quotient-boolean-algebra — ZFC Ideal7 Quotient Boolean Algebra","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-quotient.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-quotient-boolean-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal7-quotient-boolean-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal7-quotient-boolean-algebra — ZFC Ideal7 Quotient Boolean Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ced46394294c1a6\" href=\"?note=9ced46394294c1a6\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-quotient.md\">../batch19/58-df-quotient.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal I,\\mathbb B\\in V,\\ \\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(X,\\mathcal I,\\mathbb B\\in V,\\ \\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7QuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7QuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9ced46394294c1a6\" href=\"?note=9ced46394294c1a6\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-quotient.md\">../batch19/58-df-quotient.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash \\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7QuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal I,\\mathbb B)\\\\\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin\\mathcal I\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists E,\\wedge_E,\\vee_E,\\neg_E,0_E,1_E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq X\\;(\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow A\\mathbin{\\triangle}B\\in\\mathcal I)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(\\mathbb B,\\mathcal P(X),E)\n\\land0_E=[\\varnothing]_E\\land1_E=[X]_E\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A,B\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl([A]_E\\wedge_E[B]_E=[A\\cap B]_E\\land[A]_E\\vee_E[B]_E=[A\\cup B]_E\\land\\neg_E[A]_E=[X\\setminus A]_E\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge_E,\\vee_E,\\neg_E,0_E,1_E)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash \\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7QuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal I,\\mathbb B)\\\\\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin\\mathcal I\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists E,\\wedge_E,\\vee_E,\\neg_E,0_E,1_E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq X\\;(\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow A\\mathbin{\\triangle}B\\in\\mathcal I)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(\\mathbb B,\\mathcal P(X),E)\n\\land0_E=[\\varnothing]_E\\land1_E=[X]_E\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A,B\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl([A]_E\\wedge_E[B]_E=[A\\cap B]_E\\land[A]_E\\vee_E[B]_E=[A\\cup B]_E\\land\\neg_E[A]_E=[X\\setminus A]_E\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge_E,\\vee_E,\\neg_E,0_E,1_E)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC ideal definition.</li>\n<li>The Boolean operations on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B\">\\(\\mathbb B\\)</span> are induced by union, intersection, and complement modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","stat